        <mxCell id="c57" value="&lt;i&gt;Furniture, 2026-Q4 against 2026-Q3. The vertical axis starts at 1,650,000, not at zero, so that the three small steps show; the two blue bars are cut near the base. Volume, mix and price lists together add 5,640.95, and the promotion effect takes away 120,687.02, more than the whole decline of 115,046.07. No cost effect is drawn: each item has one standard cost, so a unit&#x27;s cost changes only through the mix of items, and the mix effect already holds it.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="504" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
